Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, Google Fonts): Noto Sans JP (Japanese), Barlow Condensed (numbers, plate), IBM Plex Mono (datelines, sources) - https://fonts.google.com/
Narration voice: Microsoft Edge neural voice "ja-JP-KeitaNeural" via edge-tts (online service; check Microsoft's terms before commercial use).
Music and sound effects: original, synthesised in code (numpy/scipy; saw-stack strings/brass, plucked bass/harp by physical modelling in core/audio/pluck.py of the Lemo-Opuscar library, foley from core/audio/sfx.py). No samples.
Picture: drawn entirely in code (canvas) following the Lemo-Opuscar "Broadcast News Package" style grammar (package.js / theme.js / views.js). No external images. "NEWS LINE" is a fictional channel name; no broadcaster's logo, font, colours or music are used.
Facts: Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry (METI) cashless payment ratio for 2025, released 2026-03-31 (via press reports; see README).
